{"id":"H0208","lemma":"אוֹנָם","transliteration":"onam","sayIt":"o-NAM","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Onam","meaning":"A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Gen.36.23;\nson of: Shobal (H7732);\nbrother of: Alvan (H5935), Manahath (H4506B), Ebal (H5858B) and Shepho (H8195)\n§ Onam = \"vigorous\"\n1) a Horite chief, grandson of Seir\n2) son Jerahmeel, a chief of Judah","glosses":["onam"],"count":4,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-36","v":23,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Onam"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-1","v":40,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Onam","kjv":"and Onam"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-2","v":26,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Onam","kjv":"of Onam"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-2","v":28,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Onam","kjv":"of Onam"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Genesis 36:23","note":"These are the children of Shobal: Alvan, Manahath, Ebal, Shepho, and Onam.","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 1:40","note":"The sons of Shobal: Alian, Manahath, Ebal, Shephi, and Onam. The sons of Zibeon: Aiah and Anah.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H4506","lemma":"מָנַ֫חַת","transliteration":"manachat","gloss":"Manahath"},{"id":"H7732","lemma":"שׁוֹבָל","transliteration":"shoval","gloss":"Shobal"},{"id":"H5935","lemma":"עַלְיָן, עַלְוָן ","transliteration":"alvan","gloss":"Alvan"},{"id":"H5858","lemma":"עֵיבָל","transliteration":"eval","gloss":"Obal"},{"id":"H8195","lemma":"שְׁפוֹ, שְׁפִי","transliteration":"shepho","gloss":"Shepho"},{"id":"H3396","lemma":"יְרַחְמְאֵל","transliteration":"yerachmeel","gloss":"Jerahmeel"},{"id":"H5851","lemma":"עֲטָרָה","transliteration":"atarah","gloss":"Atarah"},{"id":"H7410","lemma":"רָם","transliteration":"ram","gloss":"Ram"}],"senses":[{"id":"H0208H","gloss":"Onam","relation":"H0208H ="}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}